# Local development only (copy to .dev.vars at the repo root, next to wrangler.jsonc).
# Production needs NOTHING typed by hand (ADR-0004): the signing secret is generated by the
# Durable Object itself on first boot, and the first computer claims the deployment through a
# Cloudflare authorization — no pairing codes to copy out of build logs.
#
# MODEL_KEY is optional even here: paste your model provider's API key to seed the sealed
# model row at boot, or leave it out and add the key in the workspace's Settings later.
SERVER_KEY=local-dev-only-not-used-in-production
# MODEL_KEY=paste-your-model-provider-api-key
